2️⃣ How React Works (VERY IMPORTANT)
Traditional DOM
Directly updates DOM → slow

React DOM
Uses Virtual DOM

Changes happen in memory

React compares old vs new Virtual DOM (Diffing)

Updates only changed parts (Reconciliation)

📌 Interview line:

React improves performance by minimizing DOM updates using Virtual DOM and efficient diffing.

